{
  "name": "Inspiring Surge",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to inspire your allies to draw on their hidden reserves and keep fighting. As a Bonus Action, choose a number of allies equal to half your Proficiency (rounded up) within 60 feet that can see or hear you and aren't incapacitated. A target can immediately spend a hit die as if it had taken a rest, gaining hit points as normal.</p>",
